          "text": "Perceived occupational impact of eye appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mildly self-conscious at work; colleagues have said her eye looks tired. Worried children may comment and reports some decreased confidence. Reluctant to take time off for specialist appointments."
      }
    },
    {
